# Clandestine Meddler: "Whenever one or more suspected creatures you control attack, surveil 1." (CR 508.1m, 603.2c, 701.25a, 701.60a) Bot1 casts two Meddlers and a Memnite on turn 1: the first Meddler
# suspects the Memnite, the second suspects the first Meddler, so the Memnite and one Meddler are suspected and the other Meddler is not. On turn 3 all three attack together: the ability
# triggers once for the whole batch, one surveil that Bot1 puts into the graveyard (a second trigger would leave a second surveil to answer).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Clandestine Meddler
Clandestine Meddler
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

